	(text "leels breakout for ESP32-C6-DevKitC-1 (mounts on the back of the DevKit on two 1x16 sockets). All parts through-hole."
		(at 72 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4ddee277-8b1c-4c43-9273-0ad214d29340")
	)
	(text "Pinout = firmware normal C6 pinout: STEP 18, DIR 19, ENA 20, encoder A 10 / B 11 (Z on 21, not read yet), Nextion TX 22 / RX 23."
		(at 72 24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0d89d026-2144-46e5-aff9-3454808a38d4")
	)
	(text "U2 drives the servo opto inputs from 5 V: servo PP+/PD+ to J2 5V, PP-/PD- to J2 STEP/DIR (active low, firmware 'STEP pulses low' ticked)."
		(at 72 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c9c6b5b1-dc23-42a5-980e-29e6ecb361a1")
	)
	(text "R5/R6 hold STEP/DIR high (opto off) while the ESP32 boots. Unused channels C/D tied off."
		(at 72 32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d3a90149-9d04-4c95-b237-d37fa3b0e7f4")
	)
	(text "ENA (optional, Q1 R1 R2): open collector to servo SigIn1; drive COM to J2 GND, SigIn supply (pin 9) to 5V or 12-24 V. Pn003 = 0 to use, else omit and Pn003 = 1."
		(at 72 36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aab678a7-99a2-47ff-965d-c98c2f340f4a")
	)
	(text "Encoder: open-drain A/B/Z, 4k7 pull-ups to 3V3; encoder powered from J3 5V. J6: tie cable shields here (GND), one end only."
		(at 72 40 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2c811022-647a-41bd-aa3f-c045cea0535d")
	)
	(text "J4 5V in through D1 (1N5817) so USB and external 5V can both be connected."
